# Keep the Docker build context reproducible from the lockfile: never copy installed deps, build outputs, or
# local agent/git state into the builder stage (the image installs + builds from source).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.agents
agent-scratch
.github
**/*.log
# NOTE: apps/run-task/vendor (the Agent SDK) is intentionally NOT excluded — the run-task Dockerfile's
# explicit `COPY apps/run-task/vendor/ /app/vendor/` needs it in the build context (a .dockerignore
# exclusion is context-global and would silently defeat that COPY, yielding a no-SDK image). It is not a
# workspace package, so `pnpm install` in the broad builder stage ignores it.
